  "description": "*\"Rano, faster!!\"*\n\n\"Harry\" always dreamed of becoming a dragon rider ever since he was a young boy. Then one day he rescues a dragon and its egg from a cliff. When Rano finally hatched from the egg, he and Harry instantly become best friends. Where will the series of adventures take the dynamic duo? Will they come out victorious against their rivals? Will Harry become a dragon knight? Join the rookie rider and his baby dragon as they race against the world!\n\n(Source: DAYcomics)",
